  m_text: '02. Morale System


    Morale decreases when attacked by an enemy.

    It
    decreases by double when attacked by a counter unit.

    When an allied unit
    dies, the morale of other allied units decreases as well.

    Summoning a unit
    or using a Support Unit recharges morale.'
